<title>UK: BZW appoints new investment banking head.</title>
<headline>BZW appoints new investment banking head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW, the investment banking arm of Barclays Plc, said it has appointed Charles Stonehill as Chief Executive of its investment banking division.</p>
<p>Stonehill, 38, will have global responsibility for BZW's corporate finance and structured finance operations and will be a member of the firm's management committee.</p>
<p>Stonehill joins BZW from Morgan Stanley where he was a member of the global equity operating committee and was Managing Director responsible for the European equities division.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
